  message: "Post-ADR-0023 / ADR-0028 reframe (both fully landed): emits for metatype-based dispatch must be canonical edge_type='calls' + meta['bridge_kind']='luajit_ffi' (no new edge_type peer; drift linter is strict in pre-commit). The luajit_ffi_unresolved evidence_type was folded in ADR-0028 audit-findings 0008 — for unresolved cases, set Edge.is_resolved=False (ir.py:399) plus a canonical inference label from evidence_types_on_axis(AXIS_INFERENCE_PATHWAY). The implementation work (recognize ffi.metatype(ctype, {...}) attachments and link struct_instance:method() calls to the bound Lua-side functions) is unchanged."  # f7cf
